ements": []}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "zdol011", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ib-tw\"><div class=\"glass-card silver-border p-6 md:p-10 max-w-4xl\">\n<ul class=\"motif-list grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-x-8 gap-y-4\">\n<li class=\"font-body-lg text-base md:text-body-lg\">Craiova</li>\n<li class=\"font-body-lg text-base md:text-body-lg\">Băilești</li>\n<li class=\"font-body-lg text-base md:text-body-lg\">Calafat</li>\n<li class=\"font-body-lg text-base md:text-body-lg\">Filiași</li>\n<li class=\"font-body-lg text-base md:text-body-lg\">Segarcea</li>\n<li class=\"font-body-lg text-base md:text-body-lg\">Dăbuleni</li>\n<li class=\"font-body-lg text-base md:text-body-lg\">Bechet</li>\n<li class=\"font-body-lg text-base md:text-body-lg\">Ișalnița</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"motif-rule max-w-[180px] w-full mt-8\"><span class=\"motif-rule__gem zona-gem\"></span></div>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-6\">Calafat și Bechet adaugă în jur de o oră de drum față de Craiova. Pentru o nuntă spre Dunăre, la discuția de organizare se ia în calcul și o cazare lângă locație, nu în Craiova, ca după demontare să nu mai urmeze încă o oră de drum.</p>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zdol012", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Niciun alt județ de pe această listă nu se învecinează cu Doljul, între ele stă Oltul. Cele două drumuri spre Craiova pornesc totuși din zone pe care le acoperim: DN6 din <a href=\"/zone/teleorman/\">Teleorman</a>, pe la Roșiorii de Vede și Caracal, și DN65 din Pitești, capătul autostrăzii în <a href=\"/zone/arges/\">Argeș</a>, pe la Slatina.</p>", "text_color": "#C6C6C6", "custom_css": "selector p{margin:0}selector{max-width:768px !important}", "__globals__": {"text_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "32", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "32", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "32", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zdol013", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ib-tw\"><p class=\"mt-8\"><a class=\"font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-widest text-primary hover:text-white transition-colors inline-flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 min-h-[44px]\" href=\"/zone/\">Toate zonele deservite</a></p></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "zdol016", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "24", "bottom": "0", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "zdol015", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"zona-divider\"></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "zdol018", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "48", "right": "24", "bottom": "48", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "zdol017", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ib-tw\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary uppercase tracking-[0.2em] block mb-4\">Repertoriu</span>\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-lg text-2xl md:text-headline-lg leading-tight mb-6\" id=\"repertoriu-titlu\">Oltenia are alt pas de joc</h2>\n<p class=\"font-body-lg text-base md:text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant\">Doljul e Oltenie de câmpie, iar dintre toate zonele pe care le acoperim la vest de București, repertoriul de aici e cel mai îndepărtat de fondul muntenesc. Horele se prind de mână și se joacă mai repede decât în Muntenia, iar sârbele oltenești sunt iuți și strânse. Melodica are alt caracter: cântecul oltenesc e mai ornamentat, cu înflorituri pe care vocea și vioara și le pasează una alteia.</p>\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-lg md:text-headline-md text-on-surface leading-snug mt-9 mb-4\">Ce înseamnă asta pentru o nuntă la Craiova</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-lg text-base md:text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant\">Un program construit pe muntenescul de la București nu ține o sală din Dolj, pentru că ringul simte imediat diferența de tempo. Aici registrul oltenesc e coloana serii, nu un moment dedicat, iar jocurile muntenești intră doar dacă o parte din invitați vin din alte zone. Ordinea și proporția se stabilesc la discuția de organizare, pe lista de invitați.</p>\n\n<p class=\"mt-8\"><a class=\"font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-widest text-primary hover:text-white transition-colors inline-flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 min-h-[44px]\" href=\"/repertoriu/\">Vezi repertoriul complet</a></p>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "zdol01a", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "24", "bottom": "0", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "zdol019", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"zona-divider\"></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "zdol020", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "48", "right": "24", "bottom": "48", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "zdol01e", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "width": {"unit": "px", "size": 768, "sizes": []}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": 100, "sizes": []}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "48", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "48", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "32", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "custom_css": "selector{max-width:100%}"}, "elements": [{"id": "zdol01b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Logistică", "header_size": "div", "title_color": "#C6C6C6", "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_family": "Inter", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 14, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_weight": "600", "typography_text_transform": "uppercase", "typography_letter_spacing": {"unit": "em", "size": 0.2, "sizes": []}, "typography_line_height": {"unit": "px", "size": 20, "sizes": []}, "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zdol01c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Două sute treizeci de kilometri, planificați de la rezervare", "header_size": "h2", "title_color": "#E5E2E1", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=primary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=secondary"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_element_id": "logistica-titlu"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zdol01d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Doljul e punctul cel mai îndepărtat spre sud-vest, iar logistica se organizează ca pentru un eveniment cu drum lung: transport pe două ture și cazare pentru echipă. Kilometrii se socotesc dus-întors, cu 6 lei fiecare.</p>", "text_color": "#C6C6C6", "custom_css": "selector p{margin:0}", "__globals__": {"text_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "zdol01f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ib-tw\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-gutter max-w-4xl\">\n<div class=\"glass-card silver-border p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col gap-3\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant\">Distanță</span>\n<p class=\"font-display-lg text-3xl md:text-4xl text-on-surface\">~230 km</p>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Până la Craiova, fie pe A1 până la Pitești și apoi prin Slatina, fie pe DN6, prin Alexandria și Caracal. Localitățile de pe Dunăre mai adaugă aproximativ o oră.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"glass-card silver-border p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col gap-3\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant\">Deplasare</span>\n<p class=\"font-headline-md text-xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface\">Aproape trei ore, pentru echipament și echipă</p>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Sonorizarea pleacă prima, cu echipa tehnică, iar ora de plecare se calculează înapoi de la începerea evenimentului, ca echipa tehnică să fie la sală cu cele 4–5 ore de montaj înainte. Interpreții ajung după montaj.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"glass-card silver-border p-6 md:p-8 md:col-span-2 flex flex-col gap-3\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant\">Cazare</span>\n<p class=\"font-headline-md text-xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface\">Unde doarme echipa, stabilit dinainte</p>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">La 230 km, o petrecere care se încheie noaptea nu se continuă cu drumul înapoi imediat după demontare. Unde doarme echipa — în Craiova sau lângă locație — și când strânge echipamentul sunt subiecte pentru discuția de organizare; câte camere sunt necesare rezultă din câți oameni are pachetul ales.</p>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Forma în care se asigură cazarea se discută tot la organizare, după distanță și după preferința mirilor.</p>\n</div>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "zdol022", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "24", "bottom": "0", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "zdol021", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"zona-divider\"></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "zdol024", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "48", "right": "24", "bottom": "48", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "zdol023", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ib-tw\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto glass-card silver-border p-6 md:p-12 text-center flex flex-col items-center gap-5\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\">Pachete</span>\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-lg text-2xl md:text-headline-lg leading-tight\" id=\"pachete-titlu\">Pachet, transport și cazare, vizibile separat</h2>\n<p class=\"font-body-lg text-base md:text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant\">Pachetul muzical e cel din grila comună tuturor zonelor. Pentru Dolj oferta are trei componente scrise separat: pachetul muzical, suplimentul de transport pe cei aproximativ 460 km dus-întors până la Craiova și cazarea echipei. Niciuna nu apare abia după confirmarea datei.</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Din cele trei rânduri ale ofertei, doar pachetul depinde de ocazie: e altul pentru o <a class=\"text-primary underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/nunta/\">nuntă</a> decât pentru un <a class=\"text-primary underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/botez/\">botez</a>. Transportul și cazarea spre Craiova se calculează identic și pentru o <a class=\"text-primary underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/eveniment-privat/\">onomastică</a>, și pentru un <a class=\"text-primary underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/corporate/\">eveniment corporate</a>.</p>\n<div class=\"motif-rule max-w-[180px] w-full\"><span class=\"motif-rule__gem zona-gem\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 w-full sm:w-auto\">\n<a class=\"inline-block text-center whitespace-nowrap bg-accent text-white px-8 md:px-10 py-4 uppercase font-label-md text-label-md tracking-widest hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors w-full sm:w-auto\" href=\"/oferte/\">Vezi toate pachetele</a>\n<a class=\"btn-secundar-zona inline-block text-center whitespace-nowrap text-on-surface bg-transparent px-8 md:px-10 py-4 uppercase font-label-md text-label-md tracking-widest hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors w-full sm:w-auto\" href=\"/contact/\">Cere ofertă</a>\n</div>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "zdol026", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "24", "bottom": "0", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "zdol025", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"zona-divider\"></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "zdol031", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "48", "right": "24", "bottom": "48", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "zdol029", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "width": {"unit": "px", "size": 768, "sizes": []}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": 100, "sizes": []}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "48", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "48", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "32", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "custom_css": "selector{max-width:100%}"}, "elements": [{"id": "zdol027", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Întrebări", "header_size": "div", "title_color": "#C6C6C6", "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_family": "Inter", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 14, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_weight": "600", "typography_text_transform": "uppercase", "typography_letter_spacing": {"unit": "em", "size": 0.2, "sizes": []}, "typography_line_height": {"unit": "px", "size": 20, "sizes": []}, "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zdol028", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Ce vor să știe cei care organizează în Oltenia", "header_size": "h2", "title_color": "#E5E2E1", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=primary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=secondary"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_element_id": "faq-titlu"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "zdol02f", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "width": {"unit": "px", "size": 768, "sizes": []}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": 100, "sizes": []}, "custom_css": "selector{max-width:100%}", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "zdol02a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"faq-item\"><details open><summary aria-expanded=\"true\"><h3>Cântați oltenește cu adevărat, sau câteva piese adaptate pentru Craiova?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 -960 960 960\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M480-357.85 253.85-584l32.61-32.61L480-423.08l193.54-193.53L706.15-584 480-357.85Z\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"faq-item__answer\"><p>Pentru o nuntă în Dolj registrul oltenesc e baza programului, nu o concesie făcută gazdelor. Diferența de tempo și de ornament se aude din primele minute, iar o sală din Oltenia nu se lasă păcălită de o sârbă muntenească grăbită.</p>\n<p>Lista de piese oltenești pe care o propunem se trimite la cerere, înainte de rezervare: <span class=\"ph\">[LISTĂ REPERTORIU OLTENESC — de confirmat]</span>.</p></div></details></div>", "custom_css": "selector{margin-bottom:16px}selector h3{margin:0;padding-right:16px;font-family:\"EB Garamond\",Georgia,serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.375;color:var(--e-global-color-primary)}@media(min-width:768px){selector h3{font-size:24px}}selector .faq-item__answer{font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}selector .faq-item__answer p{margin:0}selector .faq-item__answer p+p{margin-top:12px}"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zdol02b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"faq-item\"><details><summary aria-expanded=\"false\"><h3>Vrem călușari la nuntă. Îi aduceți voi?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 -960 960 960\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M480-357.85 253.85-584l32.61-32.61L480-423.08l193.54-193.53L706.15-584 480-357.85Z\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"faq-item__answer\"><p>Călușul e una dintre tradițiile cele mai legate de Oltenia, iar la o nuntă aici are sens ca moment de spectacol. Grupul de călușari nu face însă parte din echipa noastră; se rezervă separat, de obicei de la un ansamblu local.</p>\n<p>Ce putem face e să coordonăm momentul cu programul muzical și cu ansamblul ales: <span class=\"ph\">[COORDONARE CU ANSAMBLUL — de confirmat]</span>.</p></div></details></div>", "custom_css": "selector{margin-bottom:16px}selector h3{margin:0;padding-right:16px;font-family:\"EB Garamond\",Georgia,serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.375;color:var(--e-global-color-primary)}@media(min-width:768px){selector h3{font-size:24px}}selector .faq-item__answer{font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}selector .faq-item__answer p{margin:0}selector .faq-item__answer p+p{margin-top:12px}"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zdol02c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"faq-item\"><details><summary aria-expanded=\"false\"><h3>Dacă echipa rămâne peste noapte, se poate cânta și a doua zi, la o masă în familie?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 -960 960 960\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M480-357.85 253.85-584l32.61-32.61L480-423.08l193.54-193.53L706.15-584 480-357.85Z\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"faq-item__answer\"><p>Când echipa doarme în zonă, devine posibil ceva ce la Ploiești sau la Giurgiu nu s-ar justifica: un program scurt a doua zi, la prânz, înainte de plecarea spre București. Fără drum suplimentar, costul lui ține doar de durată și de configurație.</p>\n<p>Se stabilește odată cu data, nu în seara nunții: <span class=\"ph\">[PROGRAM A DOUA ZI — de confirmat]</span>.</p></div></details></div>", "custom_css": "selector{margin-bottom:16px}selector h3{margin:0;padding-right:16px;font-family:\"EB Garamond\",Georgia,serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.375;color:var(--e-global-color-primary)}@media(min-width:768px){selector h3{font-size:24px}}selector .faq-item__answer{font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}selector .faq-item__answer p{margin:0}selector .faq-item__answer p+p{margin-top:12px}"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zdol02d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"faq-item\"><details><summary aria-expanded=\"false\"><h3>La Craiova sunt destule formații oltenești. De ce am aduce muzica din București?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 -960 960 960\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M480-357.85 253.85-584l32.61-32.61L480-423.08l193.54-193.53L706.15-584 480-357.85Z\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"faq-item__answer\"><p>E o întrebare corectă, iar răspunsul nu e că una ar fi mai bună decât cealaltă. Aducerea din București adaugă în ofertă transport și cazare, scrise separat, deci costul distanței se vede întreg și se poate compara.</p>\n<p>Merită dacă vă doriți anume solista și echipa ei; dacă singurul criteriu e prețul, comparați ofertele complete, cu sonorizare și DJ incluse, nu doar onorariul muzicienilor.</p></div></details></div>", "custom_css": "selector{margin-bottom:16px}selector h3{margin:0;padding-right:16px;font-family:\"EB Garamond\",Georgia,serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.375;color:var(--e-global-color-primary)}@media(min-width:768px){selector h3{font-size:24px}}selector .faq-item__answer{font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}selector .faq-item__answer p{margin:0}selector .faq-item__answer p+p{margin-top:12px}"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zdol02e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"faq-item\"><details><summary aria-expanded=\"false\"><h3>Invitații bucureșteni n-au jucat niciodată oltenește. Rămân pe margine?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 -960 960 960\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M480-357.85 253.85-584l32.61-32.61L480-423.08l193.54-193.53L706.15-584 480-357.85Z\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"faq-item__answer\"><p>Nu, dacă ordinea e bine gândită. Hora de mână e cel mai ușor punct de intrare: te prinzi în șir și urmezi pasul celui de lângă tine. Primele jocuri oltenești ale serii se aleg mai domoale, iar sârbele iuți vin după ce sala s-a obișnuit cu tempo-ul.</p>\n<p>Între ele, un set muntenesc scurt le dă invitaților din București un moment în care conduc ei ringul.</p></div></details></div>", "custom_css": "selector{margin-bottom:16px}selector h3{margin:0;padding-right:16px;font-family:\"EB Garamond\",Georgia,serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.375;color:var(--e-global-color-primary)}@media(min-width:768px){selector h3{font-size:24px}}selector .faq-item__answer{font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}selector .faq-item__answer p{margin:0}selector .faq-item__answer p+p{margin-top:12px}"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "zdol030", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ib-tw\"><div class=\"mt-10 md:mt-12\">\n<a class=\"font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-widest text-primary hover:text-white transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2 min-h-[44px]\" href=\"/faq/\">Vezi toate întrebările frecvente <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-[18px]\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"1em\" style=\"vertical-align:-.125em\" viewbox=\"0 -960 960 960\" width=\"1em\"><path d=\"M693.69-457.31H180v-45.38h513.69L448.39-748 480-780l300 300-300 300-31.61-32 245.3-245.31Z\"></path></svg></a>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "zdol035", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 544, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#1C1B1B", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surfacealt"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#1C1B1B}selector{border-top:1px solid rgba(68,71,72,.1)}selector{text-align:center}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "96", "right": "64", "bottom": "96", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "96", "right": "64", "bottom": "96", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "64", "right": "24", "bottom": "64", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "zdol032", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Pentru Craiova, planificarea începe cu data", "header_size": "h2", "title_color": "#E5E2E1", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=primary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=primary"}, "align": "center", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "20", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "20", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "20", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zdol033", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>La 230 km, data blochează și drumul, și cazarea, așa că prima verificare e disponibilitatea. Cu data și localitatea — Craiova, Calafat sau Dăbuleni, în sud, spre Dunăre — oferta vine cu prețuri finale, cu pachetul, drumul și cazarea pe rânduri separate; din ea alegeți pachetul.</p>", "text_color": "#C6C6C6", "custom_css": "selector p{margin:0}", "__globals__": {"text_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=quote"}, "align": "center", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "40", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "40", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "40", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zdol034", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ib-tw\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4\">\n<a class=\"inline-block whitespace-nowrap bg-accent text-white px-8 md:px-10 py-4 md:py-5 uppercase font-label-md text-label-md tracking-widest hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors w-full sm:w-auto\" href=\"https://wa.me/40722911485?text=Bun%C4%83%20ziua%21%20Organizez%20un%20eveniment%20%C3%AEn%20jude%C8%9Bul%20Dolj%20%